    <string name="wf_setting_rules">Blizzard\'s terms</string>
    <string name="wf_rules">This app follows Blizzard\'s End User License Agreement: Blizzard\'s own unmodified programs, installed by Blizzard\'s installer and signed in through Battle.net. The app never stores your password, never changes game files, never reads the game\'s memory and never talks to Blizzard\'s servers itself. Every touch is one input, as a mouse or keyboard gives it: nothing chained, repeated or automated.</string>
